l\" title=\"Tony Three Pies.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/04/Tony_Three_Pies..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210122090522\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/04/Tony_Three_Pies..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210122090522 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/04/Tony_Three_Pies..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210122090522 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Tony Three Pies.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Tony_Three_Pies..png\" data-image-name=\"Tony Three Pies..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_4\" title=\"Series 4\">4</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mel_Giedroyc\" title=\"Mel Giedroyc\">Mel Giedroyc</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/No_stars_for_naughty_boys.\" title=\"No stars for naughty boys.\">No stars for naughty boys.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dignity_intact.\" title=\"Dignity intact.\">Dignity intact.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Tony Three Pies.</b></i> is the eighth and final episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_4\" title=\"Series 4\">Series 4</a> of <i>Taskmaster</i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 13 June 2017. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Mel_Giedroyc\" title=\"Mel Giedroyc\">Mel Giedroyc</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Tony_Three_Pies.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Tony Three Pies\" was the nickname devised for <a href=\"/wiki/Noel_Fielding\" title=\"Noel Fielding\">Noel Fielding</a> by <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a>, after Noel's success in the <a href=\"/wiki/Strike_one_of_these_objects_the_furthest_distance_with_one_of_the_other_objects\" title=\"Strike one of these objects the furthest distance with one of the other objects\">Strike one of these objects the furthest distance with one of the other objects</a> task. A rubber duck is in the title card because of the <a href=\"/wiki/Do_something_surprising_with_this_rubber_duck\" title=\"Do something surprising with this rubber duck\">Do something surprising with this rubber duck</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Tony_Three_Pies.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Tony tre-tærte', which translates as 'Tony three-pies'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Kolmipiirakka-Tony', which translates as 'Triple-pie Tony'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Tony_Three_Pies.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Hugh_Dennis\" title=\"Hugh Dennis\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Hugh Dennis</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Lycett\" title=\"Joe Lycett\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joe Lycett</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lolly_Adefope\" title=\"Lolly Adefope\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lolly Adefope</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mel_Giedroyc\" title=\"Mel Giedroyc\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mel Giedroyc</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Noel_Fielding\" title=\"Noel Fielding\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Noel Fielding</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_cash\" title=\"Most cash\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most cash.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_exotic_sandwich\" title=\"Make the most exotic sandwich\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the most exotic sandwich.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Eat your exotic sandwich.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus</b> for eating Alex's beard</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>-</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>-</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>-</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>-</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus</b> for snorting an M&amp;M</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>-</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>-</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>-</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>-</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Strike_one_of_these_objects_the_furthest_distance_with_one_of_the_other_objects\" title=\"Strike one of these objects the furthest distance with one of the other objects\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Strike one of these objects the furthest distance with one of the other objects. You have three strikes with your chosen object.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Do_something_surprising_with_this_rubber_duck\" title=\"Do something surprising with this rubber duck\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Do something surprising with this rubber duck.\n</